@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant ":System" as System

activate Editor


Editor -> System : asks to create a scenario for a selected map
activate System
System --> Editor : requests scenario period (start and end date)
deactivate System


Editor -> System : provides start and end date
activate System
System --> Editor : shows all available locomotion types
deactivate System
Editor -> System : selects locomotion types to include in the scenario
activate System

loop for each selected locomotion type


    alt define availability period
        System --> Editor :requests availability period for type
        deactivate System
        Editor -> System : provides availability option
        activate System
    end
end loop
        System --> Editor : shows all available cargo types
        deactivate System


Editor -> System : selects cargo types to be part of the scenario (e.g., Iron, Coal, Silver, etc.)
activate System
System --> Editor : requests cargo behavior (import, export, transform)
deactivate System

loop for each cargo type in scenario
    Editor -> System : selects behavior(s)
    activate System
end loop
    System --> Editor : requests production frequency for generating industries
    deactivate System



Editor -> System : defines production frequency (percentage)
activate System
System --> Editor : shows all data and asks for confirmation
deactivate System

' Editor confirma dados
Editor -> System : confirms data
activate System
System --> Editor : displays operation success
deactivate System
deactivate Editor

@enduml
